  "id": "e37ab93069b9ea7ed949c28e",
  "title": "新的部落格列表樣式！",
  "summary": "前言 # 看了 shoujen.com 的貼文列表 後，覺得先用年份來當作大標題，並且分三個欄位是一種不錯的排版方式，於是決定 抄襲 模仿一下。 Before After # 舊排版 # 舊排版，一次列完全部，不好閱讀 新排版 # 新排版，分年份列出 文章至此結束，以下是語法分享。 # Hugo 語法設定 # list.html # 在 layout 中找到 list.html {{ partial \"header.html\" . }} < div class = \"content-wrapper\" > {{ if not . IsHome }} < h1 >{{ . Title | markdownify }}< / h1 > {{ end }} {{ . Content }} {{ $ pages :=…",
  "content": "<h2>\n  前言\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h2>\n\n<p>看了 <a href=\"https://shuojen.com/blog/archive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">shoujen.com 的貼文列表</a>後，覺得先用年份來當作大標題，並且分三個欄位是一種不錯的排版方式，於是決定<del>抄襲</del>模仿一下。</p>\n<h2>\n  Before After\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h2>\n\n<h3>\n  舊排版\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <div>\n    \n      \n      <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n        \n        \n          <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/musings/new-list-layout/old-list.jpg\" width=\"1607\" height=\"1279\" alt=\"舊排版，一次列完全部，不好閱讀\">\n        \n      </a>\n    \n\n    \n      <p>舊排版，一次列完全部，不好閱讀</p>\n    \n  </div>\n\n\n<h3>\n  新排版\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <div>\n    \n      \n      <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n        \n        \n          <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/musings/new-list-layout/new-list.jpg\" width=\"1977\" height=\"1276\" alt=\"新排版，分年份列出\">\n        \n      </a>\n    \n\n    \n      <p>新排版，分年份列出</p>\n    \n  </div>\n\n\n<h2>\n  文章至此結束，以下是語法分享。\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h2>\n\n<h2>\n  Hugo 語法設定\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h2>\n\n<h3>\n  list.html\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h3>\n\n<p>在 <code>layout</code> 中找到 <code>list.html</code></p>\n<div><pre><code><span><span>{{ <span>partial</span> <span>&quot;header.html&quot;</span> . }}\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span>&lt;<span>div</span> <span>class</span>=<span>&quot;content-wrapper&quot;</span>&gt;\n</span></span><span><span>  {{ <span>if</span> <span>not</span> .<span>IsHome</span> }}\n</span></span><span><span>    &lt;<span>h1</span>&gt;{{ .<span>Title</span> | <span>markdownify</span> }}&lt;<span>/</span><span>h1</span>&gt;\n</span></span><span><span>  {{ <span>end</span> }}\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span>  {{ .<span>Content</span> }}\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span>  {{ <span>$</span><span>pages</span> <span>:=</span> .<span>Pages</span> }}\n</span></span><span><span>  {{ <span>if</span> .<span>IsHome</span> }}{{ <span>$</span><span>pages</span> = .<span>Site</span>.<span>RegularPages</span> }}{{ <span>end</span> }}\n</span></span><span><span>  {{ <span>$</span><span>filteredPages</span> <span>:=</span> (<span>where</span> <span>$</span><span>pages</span> <span>&quot;Section&quot;</span> <span>&quot;!=&quot;</span> <span>&quot;&quot;</span>) }}\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span>  {{<span>/* 這裡新增一個容器 class */</span>}}\n</span></span><span><span>  &lt;<span>div</span> <span>class</span>=<span>&quot;archive-grid&quot;</span>&gt;\n</span></span><span><span>    {{ <span>range</span> <span>$</span><span>filteredPages</span>.<span>GroupByDate</span> <span>&quot;2006&quot;</span> }}\n</span></span><span><span>      &lt;<span>div</span> <span>class</span>=<span>&quot;year-group&quot;</span>&gt;\n</span></span><span><span>        &lt;<span>h2</span>&gt;{{ .<span>Key</span> }}&lt;<span>/</span><span>h2</span>&gt;\n</span></span><span><span>        &lt;<span>ul</span>&gt;\n</span></span><span><span>          {{ <span>range</span> .<span>Pages</span> }}\n</span></span><span><span>          &lt;<span>li</span>&gt;\n</span></span><span><span>            &lt;<span>span</span> <span>class</span>=<span>&quot;date&quot;</span>&gt;{{ .<span>Date</span>.<span>Format</span> <span>&quot;01/02&quot;</span> }}&lt;<span>/</span><span>span</span>&gt;\n</span></span><span><span>            &lt;<span>a</span> <span>href</span>=<span>&quot;{{ .RelPermalink }}&quot;</span>&gt;{{ .<span>Title</span> | <span>markdownify</span> }}&lt;<span>/</span><span>a</span>&gt;\n</span></span><span><span>          &lt;<span>/</span><span>li</span>&gt;\n</span></span><span><span>          {{ <span>end</span> }}\n</span></span><span><span>        &lt;<span>/</span><span>ul</span>&gt;\n</span></span><span><span>      &lt;<span>/</span><span>div</span>&gt;\n</span></span><span><span>    {{ <span>end</span> }}\n</span></span><span><span>  &lt;<span>/</span><span>div</span>&gt;\n</span></span><span><span>&lt;<span>/</span><span>div</span>&gt;\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span>{{ <span>partial</span> <span>&quot;footer.html&quot;</span> . }}\n</span></span></code></pre></div><h3>\n  style.css\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h3>\n\n<p>在你的主題的 css 檔案（通常在 static 資料夾內）中新增：</p>\n<div><pre><code><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span><span>/* 封裝容器 */</span>\n</span></span><span><span>.<span>archive-grid</span> {\n</span></span><span><span>  <span>display</span>: <span>grid</span>;\n</span></span><span><span>  <span>/* 這裡設定欄位：repeat(3, 1fr) 代表 3 欄；repeat(2, 1fr) 代表 2 欄 */</span>\n</span></span><span><span>  <span>grid-template-columns</span>: <span>repeat</span>(<span>3</span>, <span>1</span>fr);\n</span></span><span><span>  <span>gap</span>: <span>40</span><span>px</span>; <span>/* 欄位之間的間距 */</span>\n</span></span><span><span>  <span>align-items</span>: <span>start</span>; <span>/* 確保年份標題對齊頂部 */</span>\n</span></span><span><span>}\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span><span>/* 年份區塊 */</span>\n</span></span><span><span>.<span>year-group</span> <span>h2</span> {\n</span></span><span><span>  <span>border-bottom</span>: <span>2</span><span>px</span> <span>solid</span> <span>#eee</span>;\n</span></span><span><span>  <span>padding-bottom</span>: <span>10</span><span>px</span>;\n</span></span><span><span>  <span>margin-bottom</span>: <span>15</span><span>px</span>;\n</span></span><span><span>}\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span>.<span>year-group</span> <span>ul</span> {\n</span></span><span><span>  <span>list-style</span>: <span>none</span>;\n</span></span><span><span>  <span>padding</span>: <span>0</span>;\n</span></span><span><span>}\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span>.<span>year-group</span> <span>li</span> {\n</span></span><span><span>  <span>margin-bottom</span>: <span>8</span><span>px</span>;\n</span></span><span><span>  <span>display</span>: <span>flex</span>;\n</span></span><span><span>  <span>gap</span>: <span>10</span><span>px</span>;\n</span></span><span><span>}\n</span></span><span><span>\n</span></span><span><span><span>/* 手機版自動切換為單欄，避免太擠 */</span>\n</span></span><span><span>@<span>media</span> <span>(</span><span>max-width</span><span>:</span> <span>768px</span><span>)</span> {\n</span></span><span><span>  .<span>archive-grid</span> {\n</span></span><span><span>    <span>grid-template-columns</span>: <span>1</span>fr;\n</span></span><span><span>  }\n</span></span><span><span>}\n</span></span></code></pre></div>",
